    "Id": "mechdef_thunderbolt_TDR-9SE",
    "Name": "Thunderbolt TDR-9SE",
    "Details": "The 9SE variant of the Thunderbolt was introduced in 3050 as the Eridani Light Horse's update to the 5SE, based primarily around an energy weapons arsenal and maneuverability. The 'Mech is armed with a LRM-10 missile launcher for long-range combat. For close to medium ranges, the 'Mech carries a Large Pulse Laser and three medium lasers. Of note is the shifting of the missile launcher and its one ton of reloads from the right torso to the left. The additional mobility of the 9SE comes from its four jump jets, giving it a jumping distance of 120 meters.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_thunderbolt"
  },
